=2 Walkthrough
* Zoning out of the tower is required after finishing the previous quest.
* Begin quest by speaking with Chumimi, found in the basement of {z:Heavens Tower} (Windurst).
** There is an optional cutscene in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} with {n:Laityn} (G-9), if you wish to learn more about the story.
* After speaking with Chumimi, head to the basement of {z:Crawlers' Nest} and obtain a {@i:Bag of Seeds|1105} {i:Bag of Seeds|Bag of Seeds|1105} drop from either a {m:Fire Elemental} or {m:Water Elemental}.
** It is **strongly** recommended to check with {n:Appollonia} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-6) for weather in {z:Rolanberry Fields} as it is shared with {z:Crawlers' Nest} as the elementals only appear during weather.
*** Elementals will pop in the "donut room" on Map 3 with the Strange Apparatus.
** An alternative way to get the Seeds is from your {p:Garden Furrow} by telling Kuyin Hathdenna to "look for seeds" before harvesting the Furrow.
* Return to Chumimi and trade her the {@i:Bag of Seeds|1105} {i:Bag of Seeds|Bag of Seeds|1105}.
* Following this cutscene, head to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and defeat {m:Demon Generals|Demon General}, {m:Magistrates|Demon Magistrate}, {m:Chancellors|Demon Chancellor} or {m:Commanders|Demon Commander} for a {@i:Whine Cellar Key|1106} {i:Whine Cellar Key|Whine Cellar Key|1106}.
** These are found at the bottom of the four corner areas on Map 3.
*** Fall from Map 2 to get there.
* Zone into {z:Castle Zvahl Keep}
* Head to the Ore Door at (H-7) then trade the {@i:Whine Cellar Key|1106} {i:Whine Cellar Key|Whine Cellar Key|1106} to the Ore Door for a cutscene and the {@k} {k:"Foe Finder Mk. I"}.
** Hug the right wall as you enter, proceed through the iron gate, the first ore door before the 2nd iron gate will be the one to trade the key to.
* Return to Chumimi after the cutscene in the Keep, and following another short sequence, the quest is completed and you'll obtain BLM AF1 Feet, {i:Wizard's Sabots|Wizard's Sabots|14092}.

